## SQ-DCM-02 | rerun after /reload: no new KubeJS errors, recipe count vs the pack dump, [absent mods] names none of the 5 G5 mods
shell grep -h "\[absent mods\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | sed -E 's/.*absent mods\] //' | sort | uniq | cut -c1-160 | head -40
> reload
sleep 40
shell grep -cE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log; grep -hE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200 | head -8; true
shell grep -h "\[absent mods\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | sed -E 's/.*absent mods\] //' | sort | uniq | cut -c1-160 | head -40
shell ! grep -h "\[absent mods\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -E "towns_and_towers|hopo|unwrecked_ships|yuushya|cozys-improved-cats"
> dumprecipes
sleep 60
shell wc -l < kubejs/exported/recipes/all.csv; wc -l < $INST/kubejs/exported/recipes/all.csv; ls -l --time-style=+%m-%d_%H:%M $INST/kubejs/exported/recipes/all.csv
look 0 KubeJS errors after /reload; recipe count equal to the pack dump (or a listed small difference); [absent mods] lines name only mods not in srv/mods
